# Privacy Policy - Subscription Manager Free

  ## Data Collection
  This extension stores subscription data locally on your device using Chrome's storage API. We do not collect, transmit, or store any data on external servers.

  ## Data Stored
  - Subscription names, prices, currencies, categories
  - Payment dates and renewal reminders
  - Notification preferences
  - Theme preference

  ## Data Sharing
  We do not share, sell, or transfer any data to third parties.

  ## Data Security
  All data remains on your local device and is managed by Chrome's storage system.

